# ── Music School (public repo) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repo is public. Two kinds of file must never be committed to it, and the
# rules below are the second line of defence — the first is not putting them in
# the working tree at all.

# 1) LICENSED OR THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL. The app ships a named slot for each of
#    these and every reader adds their own copy on their own device.
00 Human/20 Music/School & Content/Books/
00 Human/20 Music/School & Content/Song Library/Files/*.pdf
00 Human/20 Music/School & Content/Song Library/Images/
00 Human/20 Music/School & Content/Song Library/Files/*.m4a
00 Human/20 Music/School & Content/YouTube Notes/Transcripts/
00 Human/20 Music/School & Content/Production/Manuals/
00 Human/20 Music/School & Content/Production/Plugins/Images/
00 Human/20 Music/School & Content/Production/Plugins/_Source Screenshots/
00 Human/20 Music/School & Content/Guitar/**/*.pdf
00 Human/20 Music/School & Content/Theory/Files/*.pdf
00 Human/20 Music/School & Content/Theory/Files/*.mp4
Machine/School/song-covers/
Machine/School/song-charts/
Machine/School/soundslice-meta/
Machine/School/video-thumbs/

# 2) ANYONE'S PERSONAL DATA. Progress lives on each person's device (and in
#    their own private gist if they turn sync on) — never here.
Machine/School/progress-*.json
Machine/School/local-user.json
Machine/School/calendar.json
00 Human/20 Music/Users/

# Generated single-file pages (build.py --artifact / --out) and build caches.
Machine/Scripts/school-artifact/*.html
Machine/Scripts/school-artifact/shots/
school-*.html
Machine/School/book-pages/

# docs/ IS committed — it is the built app that GitHub Pages serves.

.obsidian/
.trash/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
